    "kind": "depth",
    "x-notes": "depth: exp-activated relative depth (affine-invariant up to scale; not metric), larger is farther. confidence: exp(x) + 1, >= 1, larger is more confident. Both [1,504,504] float32, row-major over the stretched 504 x 504 input."
