      "x-notes": "ImageNet normalization (mean 0.485/0.456/0.406, std 0.229/0.224/0.225) is in the graph: feed RGB on [0,1]. The graph input is float16; the host builds float32 and converts. Upstream resizes the long side to 504 (cv2 INTER_AREA down, INTER_CUBIC up) and rounds to multiples of 14; this static graph takes a 504 x 504 stretch, with Pillow's bicubic (the gate reference's resize, matched bit for bit)."
    }
